     "represents a four-momentum carrying a Lorentz index."}], "Usage"],
  Cell["Details", "NotesSection"], Cell["The first argument is a Mom object \
or a supported momentum combination. The second is the Lorentz index \
contracted with another tensor.", "Notes"], Cell["It retains off-shell \
